<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>RideFixer Shop - E-Bike Parts Coming Soon</title>
  <meta name="description" content="RideFixer Shop is launching soon with e-bike parts, displays, controllers, batteries, motors and repair-first replacement guidance." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://shop.ridefixer.app/" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#06101d" />
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#06101d;--card:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--card2:rgba(255,255,255,.12);--text:#f8fbff;--muted:#a9b8ca;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.14);--brand:#00d4ff;--green:#22c7a9;--orange:#f3a45f;--shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:Inter,Manrope,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;color:var(--text);min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(0,212,255,.24),transparent 28%),radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(34,199,169,.18),transparent 28%),radial-gradient(circle at 75% 100%,rgba(243,164,95,.15),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg,#06101d,#081827 48%,#06101d);overflow-x:hidden}.wrap{width:min(1120px,92vw);margin:0 auto}.nav{height:78px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:900;font-size:1.22rem;letter-spacing:-.4px}.logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),var(--green));color:#00131a;font-weight:1000;box-shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(0,212,255,.25)}.nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:750}.pill{padding:10px 15px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}.hero{padding:46px 0 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch}.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--card2),var(--card));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:30px}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,.28);background:rgba(0,212,255,.10);color:#b7f4ff;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:850}h1,h2,h3{letter-spacing:-.6px;margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,5.2rem);line-height:.94;margin-top:16px}.gradient{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#fff,var(--green));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}.sub{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.hero .sub{font-size:1.08rem;max-width:680px}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none}.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),var(--green));color:#00131a;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,212,255,.22)}.btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff}.visual{display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;min-height:380px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.visual:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,212,255,.22),transparent 66%)}.bike{font-size:8rem;position:relative}.section{margin-top:18px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:16px}.item{padding:20px;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid var(--line);transition:.22s ease}.item:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(0,212,255,.38)}.icon{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:10px}.mini{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px}.mini div{padding:18px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}.mini strong{display:block;font-size:1.4rem}.notice{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(34,199,169,.14),rgba(0,212,255,.10));text-align:center}.footer{padding:30px 0 42px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer a{color:inherit} @media(max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:24px}.grid,.mini{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{height:auto;padding:14px 0}.nav .links{display:none}.card{padding:22px}.bike{font-size:6rem}.actions .btn{width:100%}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="wrap nav">
    <a class="brand" href="https://shop.ridefixer.app/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none"><span class="logo">RF</span><span>RideFixer Shop</span></a>
    <div class="links" style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center">
      <a href="#categories">Categories</a>
      <a href="#request">Request Part</a>
      <a class="pill" href="https://ridefixer.app/">Diagnostics</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="eyebrow">E-Bike Parts Marketplace • Launching Soon</span>
        <h1>Repair-first <span class="gradient">e-bike parts</span> for real riders.</h1>
        <p class="sub">RideFixer Shop is being prepared as a focused marketplace for displays, controllers, batteries, motors and common replacement parts — connected to diagnostics, compatibility and repair workflows.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:ridefixer232@gmail.com?subject=RideFixer%20Shop%20Part%20Request">Request a Part</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://ridefixer.app/error-codes">Diagnose First</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <aside class="card visual">
        <div>
          <div class="bike">🛒</div>
          <h2>Store v1 is coming</h2>
          <p class="sub">For now, send us the part you need and we’ll use it to shape the first catalogue.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section id="categories" class="card section">
      <span class="eyebrow">Planned Categories</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:12px">Everything starts from common repair needs.</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">🔋</div><h3>Batteries</h3><p class="sub">Replacement packs, range issues and battery health related parts.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">🖥️</div><h3>Displays</h3><p class="sub">SW900, S866, KT LCD and other common e-bike displays.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">⚙️</div><h3>Controllers</h3><p class="sub">Controller replacements linked to fault and communication issues.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">🎛️</div><h3>Throttles</h3><p class="sub">Throttle faults, wiring issues and common replacement units.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">🛞</div><h3>Motors & Wheels</h3><p class="sub">Hub motor, wheel and drivetrain replacement direction.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="icon">🛠️</div><h3>Repair Essentials</h3><p class="sub">Brake parts, cables, sensors and workshop accessories.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card section notice" id="request">
      <span class="eyebrow">Help us build the catalogue</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:12px">Need an e-bike part?</h2>
      <p class="sub" style="max-width:760px;margin:10px auto 0">Send the display model, error code, bike photo or part name. RideFixer Shop will prioritise real rider demand first.</p>
      <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:ridefixer232@gmail.com?subject=RideFixer%20Shop%20Part%20Request&body=Hi%20RideFixer%2C%0A%0AI%20need%20this%20e-bike%20part%3A%0A%0ADisplay%20model%3A%0AError%20code%3A%0ABike%20photo%2Fpart%20details%3A%0A%0AThanks">Request a Part by Email</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://ridefixer.app/scan">Scan Display First</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card section">
      <h2>Compatibility focus</h2>
      <div class="mini">
        <div><strong>SW900</strong><span class="sub">Display ecosystem</span></div>
        <div><strong>S866</strong><span class="sub">Controller + display</span></div>
        <div><strong>KT LCD</strong><span class="sub">Common repair path</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap footer">
    <span>© 2026 RideFixer Shop. Launching soon.</span>
    <span><a href="https://ridefixer.app/">RideFixer Diagnostics</a> · <a href="mailto:ridefixer232@gmail.com">Contact</a></span>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
